CM 868 MHz Rubber Duck - Realistic Copper
CE
# Wire 1: The Antenna (5cm)
GW 1 15 0 0 0.001 0 0 0.051 0.00075
# Wire 2: The Counterpoise (10cm)
GW 2 15 0 0 0 0 0 -0.10 0.001
GE 0
# --- MATERIAL PROPERTIES ---
# LD 5: Applies Copper conductivity to all segments of Tag 1 and Tag 2
LD 5 1 0 0 5.8E7
LD 5 2 0 0 5.8E7
# ---------------------------
# LD 0: Internal matching coil with 1.2 Ohms of parasitic resistance
# Format: LD 0, Tag, Start Seg, End Seg, Resistance, Inductance
LD 0 1 1 1 1.2 3.8E-7 0
# EX: Feed Point
EX 0 1 1 0 1 0
# FR: Frequency Sweep
FR 0 100 0 0 800 1
# RP: Radiation Pattern
RP 0 180 73 1000 0.5 0 1 5
EN
